NearTab:CreateSection("感應周圍（找出有提示框、點擊偵測、碰觸感應的東西）")
numberInput(NearTab, "掃描半徑", "預設 30", "scanRadius", 1)
NearTab:CreateButton({
    Name = "感應周圍（結果會出現在總覽）",
    Callback = function()
        local root = getRoot()
        if not root then
            notify("沒有角色", "等角色出現再試", 4)
            return
        end
        local r = C.scanRadius
        local rows, seen = {}, {}
        local function posOf(o)
            if o:IsA("BasePart") then return o.Position end
            if o:IsA("Attachment") then return o.WorldPosition end
            if o:IsA("Model") then return o:GetPivot().Position end
        end
        local function ownerOf(d)
            local cur = d.Parent
            while cur and cur ~= workspace do
                if posOf(cur) then return cur end
                cur = cur.Parent
            end
        end
        for _, d in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do
            local kind
            if d:IsA("ProximityPrompt") then
                kind = "提示框「" .. d.ActionText .. "」"
            elseif d:IsA("ClickDetector") then
                kind = "點擊偵測"
            elseif d.ClassName == "TouchTransmitter" then
                kind = "碰觸感應"
            end
            if kind then
                local owner = ownerOf(d)
                local pos = owner and posOf(owner)
                if pos then
                    local dist = (pos - root.Position).Magnitude
                    if dist <= r then
                        local key = tostring(owner)
                        local row = seen[owner]
                        if not row then
                            row = {path = pathOf(owner), dist = dist, kinds = {}}
                            seen[owner] = row
                            table.insert(rows, row)
                        end
                        table.insert(row.kinds, kind)
                    end
                end
            end
        end
        table.sort(rows, function(a, b) return a.dist < b.dist end)
        push("周圍", string.format("半徑 %d 內共 %d 個東西", r, #rows))
        for i, row in ipairs(rows) do
            if i > 25 then
                push("周圍", "…還有 " .. (#rows - 25) .. " 個沒顯示")
                break
            end
            push("周圍", string.format("距離 %.0f｜%s｜%s", row.dist, row.path, table.concat(row.kinds, "、")))
        end
        notify("感應周圍", #rows .. " 個東西，結果在「總覽」", 4)
    end,
})

